    "title": "Mirror Link Car Display",
    "description": "You are in drivingmode and wanna full mirror link phone with your car screen?\r\n\r\nMirror link car connector or screen mirroring for car allows you to connect your phone to car screen without using any cables, carlink app will help you mirror screen mirroring, screen sharing with car TV screens and all other devices so you can drive safely.\r\n\r\nWe are using screen mirroring option in your mobile devices to app mirror your phone with a car screen !\r\n\r\nMirrorlink Car play in an ultimate companion app for car to turn your car screen into phone's second screen with a perfect analogue of screen mirror link designed to enhance your driving experience. Transform your phone into a convenient car dashboard to use various applications via car's touchscreen, watch movies, play music, text, call and view the map and more. We have incorporated a wireless driving mode that seamlessly integrates with Mirror link carplay and Android Auto systems. Mirror link Car Screen is an easy phone to broadcast on any screen car, with a big mirror experience that you can Mirrorlink enabled vehicle, including web video steaming, photocast, audio streaming and simple automation screen connects in which you can automatically play and pause when you mobile phone connects to your car tv display. \r\n\r\n A simple automation car play app to connect your phone to your car tv without using any cable for screen sharing from phone screen in-car display. In addition, cast car screen link is a screen share tool among the car home apps that can be broadcast by connecting to Wi-Fi. This Mirror link phone car screen works with any device with built-in web browser and works with all car brands. Screen mirroring for car is a technique to mirror your smartphone on car screen that makes driving easier, safer and more enjoyable by broadcasting any view on screen car. \r\n\r\n<b>MirrorLink Android App Features:</b>\r\n\u2981\tSmart mirror link app works with old and new cars\r\n\u2981\tUse phone as your phone with apple car play connect\r\n\u2981\tScreen sharing smartphone to car connection stably\r\n\u2981\tMirror the screen on wireless car dashboard with one click\r\n\u2981\tWatch movies and listen music on Mirrorlink Android auto\r\n\u2981\tAccess all your vehicles within single Mirror link car play app\r\n\r\nHow to use Mirror Link Screen Connector - Screen Mirroring for car\r\n1. Make sure your phone & car both have Miracast/Wireless display option\r\n2. On car dashdroid turn on function \"Miracast\" \r\n3. Open Mirror screen link app and select \"Connect Car\" and wait for the device to be searched\r\n4. Easyconnection of screen mirroring miracast autolink will be established to connect your phone screen to car display\r\n\r\nMirrorLink car connector is simple and provides best user experience to extend your mobile content onto your Car Screen. Miracast for Android to Car is a screen mirroring assistant and you will no longer get tired of driving for hours and watch movies, photos and play games on big car screen. Without having any cable you can attach and mirror phone to CarPlay screen without any problem. \r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nMirror Link Car Display is owned by us and we are not affiliated, associated, authorized, sponsored or endorsed by, or in any way officially connected with any other apps or companies.",
